	<section_number>55.1-2007</section_number>
	<catch_line>Exclusive and common rights of owners</catch_line>
	<text>
		An apartment owner has an exclusive right to his apartment and has a common right to a share, with other co-owners, in the common elements of the property.
	</text>
	<history>1962, c. 627, § 6, § 55-79.6; 2019, c. 712.</history>
</law>
